    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Take on the new world</h2> Embark on a violent adventure in a new world, battling the unfriendly monster residents that call it home. Remember, time is of the essence; dawdle too long and the locals will double their efforts to end your journey prematurely!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951460/extras/e6f8cc7a2584e1dbc6aeebd1213b0592.poster.avif?t=1733329998\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951460/extras/e6f8cc7a2584e1dbc6aeebd1213b0592.webm?t=1733329998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951460/extras/e6f8cc7a2584e1dbc6aeebd1213b0592.mp4?t=1733329998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Brutal Boss battles</h2> if you battle with courage and gear up wisely, you just might stake your claim as the top dog by vanquishing the big bosses lurking at each level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wanna talk to the developer</h2>Join the Official Discord! (linked in the info section)<br>I'm more than happy to talk to anyone who plays my games, if I'm not loitering in the Voice channel, just type a message in any channel and I'll be there. <br>If you have any feedback or ideas, I'm happy to listen.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Take on the new world</h2> Embark on a violent adventure in a new world, battling the unfriendly monster residents that call it home. Remember, time is of the essence; dawdle too long and the locals will double their efforts to end your journey prematurely!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951460/extras/e6f8cc7a2584e1dbc6aeebd1213b0592.poster.avif?t=1733329998\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951460/extras/e6f8cc7a2584e1dbc6aeebd1213b0592.webm?t=1733329998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951460/extras/e6f8cc7a2584e1dbc6aeebd1213b0592.mp4?t=1733329998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Brutal Boss battles</h2> if you battle with courage and gear up wisely, you just might stake your claim as the top dog by vanquishing the big bosses lurking at each level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wanna talk to the developer</h2>Join the Official Discord! (linked in the info section)<br>I'm more than happy to talk to anyone who plays my games, if I'm not loitering in the Voice channel, just type a message in any channel and I'll be there. <br>If you have any feedback or ideas, I'm happy to listen.",
